{"unit_id":"Light-EI__dsh-chat-perf-css#card-zh","repo":"Light-EI/dsh-chat-perf-css","commit":"51be1639c338253fa761108ee7d98cad6e3cd446","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-chat-perf-css 是一款面向 DSH Web 和桌面界面的长会话渲染减负插件。它通过 DSH 客户端插件入口向页面注入一条 CSS 规则，使视口外的消息正文可以跳过样式计算、布局和绘制，并用占位尺寸维持滚动区域。插件排除 SVG 和文件图标，避免图标占用消息占位高度；卸载时会移除样式。它适合消息很多、浏览长对话时滚动和重绘吃力的 DSH 用户。它不需要 API 密钥、账号或额外外部服务配置。","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:28-48","client.js:51-61","index.js:1-11"]}
{"unit_id":"Light-EI__dsh-chat-perf-css#card-en","repo":"Light-EI/dsh-chat-perf-css","commit":"51be1639c338253fa761108ee7d98cad6e3cd446","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-chat-perf-css helps long DSH chats scroll more smoothly. Its client plugin injects CSS so off-screen message bodies skip style, layout, and painting while retaining placeholder space. It excludes SVG and file icons and removes the style when unloaded. No API key or external service is needed.","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:28-48","client.js:51-61","index.js:1-11"]}
