{"unit_id":"Light-EI__dsh-chat-perf-css#feature-1","repo":"Light-EI/dsh-chat-perf-css","commit":"51be1639c338253fa761108ee7d98cad6e3cd446","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-chat-perf-css 的功能「屏外消息渲染减负」：让不在视口内的消息正文跳过样式、布局和绘制。插件加载后自动注入 CSS，浏览器按需渲染消息子树，并保留估算占位高度。","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:12-15","client.js:48-56"]}
{"unit_id":"Light-EI__dsh-chat-perf-css#feature-2","repo":"Light-EI/dsh-chat-perf-css","commit":"51be1639c338253fa761108ee7d98cad6e3cd446","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-chat-perf-css 的功能「排除非消息图标」：CSS 选择器排除带图标类的元素和 SVG，避免文件类型图标被当作消息正文并占据占位空间。该规则随客户端插件加载自动生效。","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:33-48"]}
{"unit_id":"Light-EI__dsh-chat-perf-css#feature-3","repo":"Light-EI/dsh-chat-perf-css","commit":"51be1639c338253fa761108ee7d98cad6e3cd446","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-chat-perf-css 的功能「卸载时清除样式」：客户端插件创建带有插件标识的 style 元素并添加到页面；卸载时通过 disposer 移除该元素，避免插件规则继续留在页面。","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:51-61"]}
